"""Kubernetes Provider Normalizer Tests — Phase 13G-4.

Tests for KubernetesProviderNormalizer:
    - Platform/Cluster normalization (K8s → canonical)
    - Node normalization (K8s Node → canonical Node)
    - Pod → ExecutionEnvironment(POD)
    - Container → ExecutionEnvironment(CONTAINER)
    - Service → Network(VIRTUAL)
    - PV → Storage(PV), PVC → Storage(PVC)
    - Relationship evidence (Pod→Node node_ref resolution)
    - Identity separation (canonical_id != provider_id)
    - Provenance preserved from snapshot
    - No Physical/OS/Workload/Accelerator created (conservative)
    - Negative tests (malformed, missing fields, no inference)

NO live Kubernetes connection. All fixtures are synthetic/in-memory.
"""
